<H3>HOW THIS FILE WAS MADE</H3>

<UL>
<li>Open Eva's file KTindexuni.doc (dated 23 august 2004)
<li>Select everything
<li>Start "BlocNote" (NotePad)
<li>Paste, and save in UTF8 text format (KTindE.utf)
<li>apply UTF_2pdy.bat and obtin a new file  (KTindE.pdy)
<li>run the dos command: [find "v.r." KTindE.pdy &gt; kt_vr.pdy
<li>"slightly" edit the result and make it into an hyperlinked file
